'''Adurite '''is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 1]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The blade is made out of the dusty crimson red adurite texture with small black blotches over it, hence the name. The guard is white, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It derives from Roblox’s popular [https://roblox.fandom.com/wiki/Adurite_(series) Adurite Series].
* It has a [[Adurite (Gun)|partner gun]] of the same name.

